# 换行统一：仓库内一律 LF，避免 Windows 上 checkout 出 CRLF 把 shell 脚本跑废
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理必须 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件不要做任何换行/文本处理
*.xlsx binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# 这些文件在 GitHub 上按对应语言高亮，也便于 diff
*.py   text
*.sh   text
*.conf text
*.html diff
*.json text
